Machine names
Can compute a Pup-like address #net#host from an Arpa address [a.b.c.d] via:
1. net _ a+b+c;  -- overflows; no collision
host _ d;
2. net _ b+c; -- overflows; no collision
host _ d;
3. net _ c;  -- no overflow or collision
host _ d;

